---
// Aether Hero Section mit Reality Stone Vibe
---

<section class='relative isolate pt-14 pb-20 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-950 via-red-950/20 to-dark-950'>
  <div class='absolute inset-x-0 -top-40 -z-10 transform-gpu overflow-hidden blur-3xl sm:-top-80' aria-hidden='true'>
    <div
      class='relative left-[calc(50%-11rem)] aspect-1155/678 w-[36.125rem] -translate-x-1/2 rotate-[30deg] bg-gradient-to-tr from-red-500/20 to-rose-600/20 opacity-30 sm:left-[calc(50%-30rem)] sm:w-[72.1875rem]'
      style='clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)'></div>
  </div>

  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl'>
    <div class='mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center'>
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30'>
        <i class='fa-solid fa-atom text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
        <span class='text-red-400 font-semibold'>High-Performance Data Transmission</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class='gsap-fadein text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-6' style='animation-delay: 0.15s'>
        Aether
      </h1>

      <p class='gsap-fadein text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-8' style='animation-delay: 0.3s'>
        <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 to-rose-500'>
          Sicherer Dateitransfer. Ohne Spuren zu hinterlassen.
        </span>
      </p>

      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <p class='gsap-fadein text-xl md:text-2xl text-light-300 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto' style='animation-delay: 0.45s'>
        Aether überträgt Daten schneller, als Photonen durch Glas fliegen. Ohne Registry-Einträge, ohne Cookies, ohne Spuren. Nur Daten. Von A nach B. Und dann ins Nichts.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center' style='animation-delay: 0.6s'>
        <a 
          href='https://aether.waldheim.dev' 
          class='gsap-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-rose-600 text-white font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/50 transition-all'
          aria-label='Aether kostenlos starten'
        >
          <i class='fa-solid fa-rocket' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          Jetzt kostenlos starten
        </a>
        <a 
          href='/aether/#pricing' 
          class='gsap-btn inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-dark-800 border border-red-500/30 text-white font-semibold hover:border-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/30 transition-all'
          aria-label='Zu den Aether Preisen springen'
        >
          <i class='fa-solid fa-tag' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          Preise ansehen
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Tech Highlights -->
      <div class='gsap-fadein mt-16 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 text-light-400' style='animation-delay: 0.75s'>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
          <i class='fa-solid fa-shield-check text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          <span>TLS 1.3 Verschlüsselung</span>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
          <i class='fa-solid fa-map-location-dot text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          <span>Hosting in Deutschland</span>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
          <i class='fa-solid fa-bolt text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          <span>CDN-beschleunigt</span>
        </div>
        <div class='flex items-center gap-2'>
          <i class='fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-red-400' aria-hidden='true'></i>
          <span>DSGVO-konform</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
